1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,056
The message said Jason was dead. Lucia
heard him arguing with the motel

2
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:07,000
shower through the bathroom door.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,278
A photograph followed. His boot beside a
bloodstained sheet. The sender

4
00:00:11,278 --> 00:00:14,000
demanded cash to keep her name out.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,133
She remembered that boot yesterday.
Someone had cleaned their old room

6
00:00:19,133 --> 00:00:21,000
after they checked out.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,421
He emerged carrying both boots, furious
about cold water. Lucia held up

8
00:00:25,421 --> 00:00:28,000
the photograph. His anger became a grin.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,353
The sheet was theirs, too. He had
spilled red sports drink while opening

10
00:00:33,353 --> 00:00:35,000
it with his teeth.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,278
Lucia photographed the very alive Jason
holding both matching boots. Then

12
00:00:39,278 --> 00:00:42,000
she sent it back with one question.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,812
Would their photographer also bill them
for laundry? The typing dots

14
00:00:46,812 --> 00:00:49,000
appeared, vanished, and stayed gone.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,789
Jason finally found hot water. Lucia put
the cash away. Tonight, the only

16
00:00:53,789 --> 00:00:56,000
thing murdered was the shower pressure.
